# Every path falls to the maintainer today. This file exists so that when a
# second maintainer appears, ownership is a one-line change rather than a
# convention nobody wrote down.
#
# Branch protection does NOT currently require code-owner review: GitHub will
# not let you approve your own pull request, so requiring it with a single
# maintainer deadlocks every merge. Turn on "Require review from Code Owners"
# the day someone else can approve.

